Error [E1258]: a sandbox can't use any effect
 Why: this package builds as `target: sandbox` (D-PLUGIN1=B) — it uses: Env. Sandboxes run with zero host authority; there is no gate or grant to widen this (I1 — the sandbox is the safety boundary, not an opt-in).
 Fix: remove the effectful call, or move it out of the sandbox into the host program that loads it

